乙太網標頭乙太網標頭包含5欄位:","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"Preamble -- SFD -- Destination -- Source -- Type 7 bytes -- 1 byte -- 6 bytes -- 6 bytes -- 2 bytes","zh":"序言 -- -- sfd -- --目的端 -- 來源-- 型別7位元組 --1位元組 --6位元組 --6位元組 --2位元組","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"乙太網拖拉機 -- -- 封包 -- -- 乙太網標頭乙太網標頭包含5欄位:\n序言 -- -- sfd -- --目的端 -- 來源-- 型別7位元組 --1位元組 --6位元組 --6位元組 --2位元組","kind":"prose"},{"en":"PREAMBLE:","source":"text","id":"p22-b21","segments":[{"en":"PREAMBLE:","zh":"序言:","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"序言:","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nLength: 7 bytes (56 bits) \n• \nAlternating 1's and 0's \n• \n10101010 * 7x \n• \nAllows devices to synchronize their receiver clocks","source":"text","id":"p22-b22","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Length: 7 bytes (56 bits)","zh":"長度 :7位元組數 (E)56位數)","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Alternating 1's and 0's","zh":"替換1和0","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"10101010 * 7x","zh":"10101010 * 7x","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Allows devices to synchronize their receiver clocks","zh":"允許裝置同步接收時鐘","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n長度 :7位元組數 (E)56位數)\n•\n替換1和0\n•\n10101010 * 7x\n•\n允許裝置同步接收時鐘","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":23,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0023.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"SFD : ‘Start Frame Delimiter’","source":"text","id":"p23-b1","segments":[{"en":"SFD : ‘Start Frame Delimiter’","zh":"sfd: \" 開始訊框界限 \"","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"sfd: \" 開始訊框界限 \"","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nLength: 1 byte(8 bits) \n• \n10101011 \n• \nMarks end of the PREAMBLE and beginning of rest of frame.","source":"text","id":"p23-b2","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Length: 1 byte(8 bits)","zh":"長度 :1位元組( B)8位數)","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"10101011","zh":"10101011","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Marks end of the PREAMBLE and beginning of rest of frame.","zh":"標出前言之末並起後出訊框.","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"•\n長度 :1位元組( B)8位數)\n•\n10101011\n•\n標出前言之末並起後出訊框.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"DESTINATION AND SOURCE","source":"text","id":"p23-b3","segments":[{"en":"DESTINATION AND SOURCE","zh":"目的端和來源","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"目的端和來源","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nLayer 2 Address \n• \nIndicates the devices sending / receiving the frame \n• \nMAC = ’Media Access Control’ \n• \n= 6 byte (48-bit) address of the physical device","source":"text","id":"p23-b4","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Layer 2 Address","zh":"層 2 地址","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Indicates the devices sending / receiving the frame","zh":"表示傳送/接收 訊框 的裝置","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"MAC = ’Media Access Control’","zh":"MAC= \" 媒體訪問控制 \"","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"= 6 byte (48-bit) address of the physical device","zh":"= 6位元組( E)48-bit)物理裝置的地址","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"•\n層 2 地址\n•\n表示傳送/接收 訊框 的裝置\n•\nMAC= \" 媒體訪問控制 \"\n•\n= 6位元組( E)48-bit)物理裝置的地址","kind":"prose"},{"en":"TYPE / LENGTH","source":"text","id":"p23-b5","segments":[{"en":"TYPE / LENGTH","zh":"型別/ 長度","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"型別/ 長度","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \n2 bytes (16-bit) field \n• \nA value of 1500 or less in this field indicates the LENGTH of the encapsulated packet (in bytes) \n• \nA value of 1536 or greater in this field indicates the TYPE of the encapsulated packet and length \nis determined via other methods. \n• \nIPv4 = 0x0800 (hexadecimal) = 2048 in decimal \n• \nIPv6 = 0x86DD (hexadecimal) = 34525 in decimal \n• \nLayer 3 protocol used in the encapsulated Packet, which is almost always Internet Protocol (IP) \nversion 4 or version 6.","source":"text","id":"p23-b6","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"2 bytes (16-bit) field","zh":"2位元組(16-bit)欄位","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"A value of 1500 or less in this field indicates the LENGTH of the encapsulated packet (in bytes)","zh":"此欄位中的 1500 或以下值表示封裝 封包 (以位元組計) 的長度","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"A value of 1536 or greater in this field indicates the TYPE of the encapsulated packet and length is determined via other methods.","zh":"本欄位的值為1536或以上,表示封裝封包的型別,長度透過其他方法確定.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"IPv4 = 0x0800 (hexadecimal) = 2048 in decimal","zh":"IPv4=0x0800 (十六進位制)=小數 2048","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"IPv6 = 0x86DD (hexadecimal) = 34525 in decimal","zh":"IPv6=0x86DD(十六進位制)=小數 34525","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Layer 3 protocol used in the encapsulated Packet, which is almost always Internet Protocol (IP) version 4 or version 6.","zh":"封裝封包中使用的圖層3協議,幾乎總是網際網路協議(IP)版本4或版本6.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n2位元組(16-bit)欄位\n•\n此欄位中的 1500 或以下值表示封裝 封包 (以位元組計) 的長度\n•\n本欄位的值為1536或以上,表示封裝封包的型別,長度透過其他方法確定.\n•\nIPv4=0x0800 (十六進位制)=小數 2048\n•\nIPv6=0x86DD(十六進位制)=小數 34525\n•\n封裝封包中使用的圖層3協議,幾乎總是網際網路協議(IP)版本4或版本6.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"The ETHERNET TRAILER contains: \nFCS","source":"text","id":"p23-b7","segments":[{"en":"The ETHERNET TRAILER contains:","zh":"網易網預告片包含:","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"FCS","zh":"FCS","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"網易網預告片包含:\nFCS","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \n‘FRAME CHECK SEQUENCE’ \n• \n4 bytes (32 bits) in length \n• \nDetects corrupted data by running a 'CRC' algorithm over the received data \n• \nCRC = \"Cyclic Redundancy Check\"","source":"text","id":"p23-b8","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"‘FRAME CHECK SEQUENCE’","zh":"\" 訊框 檢查序列 \"","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","